   "rule": {
    "title": "A state, described",
    "body": "Perfect participles (λελυκώς, λελυμένος) describe a resulting state: γεγραμμένος, written; ἠγαπημένος, beloved. εἰμί + participle ('periphrastic') builds compound tenses: ἦν διδάσκων, he was teaching; ἐστὲ σεσῳσμένοι, you are saved.",
    "examples": [
